WEBVTT

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:16.830
I can't do it now, but I won't give up

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.980
Because I've already woken up

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:25.050
The burning excitement reflects the times

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:29.770
My burning soul

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.500
No

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:02.660
We'll be right back.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:37.750
Rosalia's Gaplant and Boron's Ashimar struck the Odumla in waves.

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:42.280
During the attack, Amuro and Kotz flew a freighter into the middle of the battle.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:45.640
This was how Amuro Ray joined Hayato and the others.

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:07.100
As long as it moves.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.860
I'm going right back out, so just take care of the critical repairs.

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:10.500
Yes, sir.

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:16.270
I thought it'd be rammed by a freighter.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:17.800
Major!

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:19.230
Major Buron!

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:25.140
I just wanted to thank you again, sir.

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:27.910
Because of you, I was able to have my gap plant repaired.

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:29.670
She's thanking me again.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.460
all cyber new types make a habit of repeating things major i'd like to join your team sir

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:45.010
major wait no matter what it takes i have to stop those villains those villains i don't like the way

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:52.350
you said that i'm sorry but it's difficult and sometimes i just can't take it the thought that

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:58.160
they'd want to make the sky fall the sky fall that's what they'll do the AU is a group that

00:02:58.160 --> 00:02:59.960
wants to wipe out the people of earth by drop

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:08.670
I saw it happen once. It's as if the sky were falling. I'll never forget it.

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:17.250
A.U.G. members hate the idea of polluting the Earth. They wouldn't do that.

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:21.170
I dream of it every night. I dream the sky is falling.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.820
I understand, Ensign. You can join my team.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:28.650
Thank you very much, sir.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:45.790
so they've gone to Japan.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:50.510
Yeah. Was it your idea for Frau to come see me?

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:51.720
I hope that was alright.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:52.460
It's fine.

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:55.310
I'm glad I sent them to you, Amuro.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.780
You brought Kotz here, just like I thought you would.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:01.250
What do you mean by that?

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:04.190
He was dying to get off Earth and go into space.

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:08.030
But Frau hated the idea and wouldn't allow it.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.130
Can you blame her?

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:12.290
There's no mother in the world who wants to send her child to war.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:12.910
You're right.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:14.790
And it's no different for a foster mother.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.850
But you know, regardless of how their parents feel,

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:19.410
children will do whatever they want.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:22.960
When I look at Kotz, I can't help but think about how old I'm getting.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:25.740
Come on, you're too young to be talking like that.

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:29.400
I was actually hoping that you'd be the one to train Kotz in mobile suit combat.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:29.970
Are you...

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:33.180
Sure about that? This is all about retraining me, right?

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:36.080
Yes?

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.360
If you have a moment, I'd like your help with something.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:38.880
Roger.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:40.100
Was that Char?

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:41.740
That was Lieutenant Quattro.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.580
No matter what he says, he's still Char Aznable to me.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.100
You just worry too much.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.980
So this is the 360-degree monitor.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:58.170
This is awesome.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:04:59.780
Hey, hands off!

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:03.220
Sorry about that.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.880
It's okay. I was working on the system.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.670
You didn't want to shock, did you?

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:10.710
No. I just wanted to say how impressed I was.

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:14.330
I mean, about the way you were piloting the Gundam Arc 2 in the battle the other day.

00:05:14.510 --> 00:05:17.500
Camille, take care of Cox.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:18.700
But...

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.960
Don't worry. He knows how to operate a mobile suit.

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:23.410
Right, I gotcha.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:26.780
So, you know about mobile suits?

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.530
Well, you know my father's the director of the War Museum.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.820
So every chance I get, I've been practicing on the older models.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:33.620
At Kennedy?

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:34.280
Yeah.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.280
Your father doesn't seem that old.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.250
He's really my foster father.

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:41.600
Well, that's better than having no father.

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:41.900
Huh?

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:45.420
Do you know Amuro Ray very well?

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:45.880
Sure.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.620
I was always with him on the white base during the one-year war.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:49.380
Are you serious?

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:51.490
He was like an idol to us.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:55.430
But lately, he's been acting like a different person.

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:58.290
Well, it was impressive the way he rammed that freighter into the enemy.

00:05:58.720 --> 00:05:59.960
I know, but I'm not sure...

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.720
He doesn't look so happy.

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:06.920
If we had to, we could fight with just these sleds,

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:08.040
since you have so many of them.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:09.750
But will they be back?

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:10.510
They will.

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:13.210
That brand-new mobile suit looks like it has something to prove.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.860
Sean, why did you return to Earth?

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:23.900
Will Kai have information for us? At Hickory?

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:24.880
Can't be sure.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.640
Finding the location of the Titan's main base won't be easy for him.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:29.960
They say people at...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:34.160
a tendency to underestimate the abilities of their own family members. I guess it's true.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:42.060
Kai was a crew member on the white base with you. I believe in him. I'm confident he won't let us

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:55.020
down. It was pretty impressive ramming a big unwieldy freighter into a mobile suit that's

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:58.540
faster than you. What's your reason for returning to the earth sphere?

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:06.620
I came to laugh at you. That is what you wanted to hear, isn't it?

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:11.200
I didn't choose to end up like this. I'm sure you understand that.

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:14.500
And yet, you don't like to hear sentimental advice.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:15.000
Huh?

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:18.570
In that case, I would like to see you live up to Katsa's expectations.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.760
That's the best advice I can give you.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.440
Char, why did you return to Earth?

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.720
Lala's spirit still remains in the Earth sphere.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.680
There's no way I could find it beyond Mars.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:31.280
Lala...

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:35.720
Retreating into your own shell like this is only helping the Earth Federation government.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:38.380
No, it's actually helping the Titans.

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:40.840
I can't do anything if I don't get into space.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:44.840
Remember that a bird in a cage is nothing but a plaything for others.

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:55.510
Mr. Amuro? Late night snack?

00:07:57.300 --> 00:07:58.440
Sure, thanks a lot.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:07:59.980
Listen, I was...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.680
I was hoping I'd have a chance to meet you.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:05.510
People go on and on about Amaro this and Amaro that.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:09.460
It's a pain the way they're always comparing the things I do with the things you did.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:13.420
I need to know. How can I possibly live up to everyone's expectations?

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:16.400
I was about your age when I first fought in a Gundam.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:20.240
Back then I was desperate. I have no idea how I managed to do anything.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.160
What has Kotz been saying about me?

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:28.340
He must have said something to you.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.860
I don't know. Why don't you just go and ask him yourself?

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:34.270
Camille, wait.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:35.150
Excuse me.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.680
What in the world am I doing here?

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:55.440
It's the way. Now your hands can support you in your firing position.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.200
What if the Aiyuk's Garada actually makes it across the Pacific?

00:08:59.470 --> 00:08:59.970
They can't...

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:04.760
get away no matter where they go the forces in new guinea will be waiting for them new guinea

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:11.840
is that where our new main base is located that's right i'm sure you both pay attention to your

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:12.260
balance

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:43.880
An airplane? It's a biplane!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.980
What a beautiful sight.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.710
Plane, at 2 o'clock!

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:59.690
Oh, belongs to Caraba. I'm certain.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:01.880
Yeah.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:02.560
Dad!

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:03.840
Okay.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.880
We'll have to reduce speed and altitude.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.120
Make sure the rear hatch is open for them.

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:08.800
Roger that.

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:34.290
Is it okay?

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:56.330
Great to wake you all up so early.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:10:59.820
Hi, I'm Viltana.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:02.420
Hickory's been waiting for you.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.140
Pleased to meet you.

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:05.080
I'm Director Hayato Kobayashi.

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.290
You're Kotz, aren't you?

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:07.770
Yeah.

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:11.020
You look like you're a nice kid.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:15.680
Look at that plane.

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:17.740
Ah, Camille's here.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.050
This is Beltachika of Karabakh.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:23.520
So how do you like my airplane?

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:24.560
A great replica.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:25.960
Why, thank you.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.330
Hey, where's Amaru?

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:29.190
Go and wake him up.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:29.610
Right.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:34.100
And it's not just the Beechcraft. The pilot seems like a really cool lady.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:39.920
Hey, where'd you go yesterday? Aren't you interested in the new Gundam, Amaro?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:41.980
Does it bother you that they made a Mark II?

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.340
Will you dry up? Leave me alone.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:49.630
And then...

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.810
What Char and Hayato insinuating?

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:56.620
Why would they let some teenager pilot the Gundam while ignoring me?

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:58.280
What do they want from me?

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:16.680
The shuttle at Hickory is capable of carrying three mobile suits into space.

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:21.220
Oh, Amuro. Allow me to introduce.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:26.170
I already heard. Pleased to meet you. My name's Amuro Ray.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.810
Is that so? So you're the one.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:31.060
Huh?

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:33.570
That's Helen Helen.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:34.280
Huh.

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:36.260
You use my favorite soap.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:36.820
Really?

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.700
You're famous, you know.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:44.130
Why do we have Helen Helen on board the Audumla?

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:45.140
Beats me.

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:48.030
Help yourself to some fruit, Amuro.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:49.670
You're the one who brought these?

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:50.170
Yes.

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:56.680
A new type, but you don't look different.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:58.290
Sorry to disappoint you.

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:04.060
It's very strange. I always thought you would look a little more warlike.

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:05.640
Actually, I'm relieved.

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:10.000
I'd hate to think that the Aeyug and Karaba were unconcerned about taking lives.

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:13.480
Hiding behind the excuse of just cause like the Titans.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:18.310
I was so worried that we were just another version of the Earth Federation government.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:19.750
I'm listening.

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:25.840
Who's that person in the sunglasses?

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:29.730
That's Lieutenant Quatro of the Aeyug. He's in charge of this operation.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.860
What is she afraid of?

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:37.230
Why don't you join the others in the lounge?

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:42.760
I don't want to be near Amaro.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:45.410
Coming up on San Francisco?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.140
In about five minutes.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.170
Though there's no longer a city there.

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:52.310
I felt like he glared at me.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:53.190
That was scary.

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:56.590
He looks like the type of person who can't live in a world without war.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.210
But you're a member of Karaba.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:13:59.970
You can't be totally...

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:05.680
You're right, but I don't feel he's an enlightened, peace-loving man.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:10.340
No, you're wrong about him. Deep inside, he's a gentle person.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:22.080
Sorry, did I... did I say something I shouldn't have?

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:27.380
No, you don't have to worry about it. It has more to do with Amuro than with you.

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:29.880
That's not...

00:14:30.316 --> 00:14:32.316
Thanks for watching!

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:09.250
Sindrozamia's heading out?

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:09.670
Yes, sir.

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:11.450
Thank you for taking us in.

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:12.850
I'll repay you with a victory.

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:21.040
How many are there?

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:21.960
Just one, sir.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:22.980
Very persistent.

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:26.560
I'm gonna use this one.

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:27.120
Go ahead.

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:33.590
I should be in this fight as well.

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:42.170
What are you doing? Who's operating it?

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:45.030
Gundam Mark II is moving out? Who's in it?

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.880
Kotz, do it!

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:51.350
Oh, Kotz, stop it! You're not ready for this yet.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:52.510
Open the hatch.

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:04.620
Okay, Camille, you'll have to go out in the Rick Diaz.

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:05.160
Roger.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.160
What's he doing?

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:08.210
Was that Kotz?

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:09.220
Kotz?

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:13.080
Nice young boy.

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:14.730
You're not ready.

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:15.690
Are you kidding?

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:18.770
You haven't touched a mobile suit for seven years.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:20.650
At least Kotz has been training.

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:22.090
You can help defend.

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:25.080
Listen, I was the pilot of Gundam.

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:28.460
Amuro Ray, he used to be a pilot.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:29.960
Someone who fought as a...

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:48.600
This is strange. He said he was going out to fight, but now he's shaking with fear.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:59.980
He doesn't seem like a new type now, what it is. Just like I have.

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.560
He has a fear of the sky falling.

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:03.740
He has a fear of fighting.

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:06.690
Up or down? What should we do?

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:09.430
We'll descend. I still don't know how many we're up against.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:39.180
only two units, they don't stand a chance.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:45.070
Where's the end on the right? Or the left?

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:52.510
Was that a Hi-Zach?

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.210
Which one of these screens is the enemy's search monitor?

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:57.970
This is different from a Zaku. That's it?

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:08.470
I won't make that mistake twice.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.000
Isn't this the same pilot from yesterday?

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:26.700
It must be some kind of trick.

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.770
Whatever your plan is, it doesn't matter.

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:41.670
Crashing, he's definitely a different pilot.

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:07.800
I'll use that Gundam as a shield.

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:11.390
Is it escaping?

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:12.550
I'm right beside you.

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.110
Look after Cox in the Mark II.

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:14.950
Roger, Lieutenant.

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:16.500
No!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.480
It's using our slant!

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:37.990
It sends a pressure.

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.880
After us, there's no sign of any mobile suits.

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:10.940
Let's go in silver senses!

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:15.000
Don't you realize how much trouble your stupid adventure is causing for all of us?

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:15.570
Huh?

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:18.820
It'll be too late for regrets if the Mark II is destroyed.

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:20.700
I understand.

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:26.820
Got it.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.560
You've been attacking us like this with some kind of game!

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:10.530
How's Kotz?

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:11.710
He's gonna be fine.

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:13.290
Did you see that pilot?

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:14.230
What was that?

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:17.810
It seems some energy has been released from a misguided mind.

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:19.480
Don't worry about it.

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:20.170
Okay.

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:27.100
Zombie up bottom.

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:29.080
It was her over-aggressiveness.

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.030
That caused her defeat.

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:36.680
This is inexcusable!

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:38.370
I'm sorry about all this.

00:21:38.530 --> 00:21:39.870
Really, but something happened.

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:40.590
It's like...

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.550
I didn't see the enemy.

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:43.650
I sensed her.

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:44.050
Quiet!

00:21:44.350 --> 00:21:46.090
What good is that gonna do you?

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:47.560
It could be a coincidence.

00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:50.470
Once doesn't mean you're developing some kind of ability.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.520
You should listen to your father.

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:54.440
He's right.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.380
Although, Kotz really did sense something out there.

00:21:57.750 --> 00:21:59.960
Even so, I can't forgive him for this...

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:05.920
of stupidity the selfish behavior of one person could end up costing everyone their lives you

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:11.260
don't just forgive something like that what's wrong with you amuro the younger pilots were

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:16.620
out there fighting today maybe you no longer feel the same passion in your heart that you're used to

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:50.560
...remains on the west coast with the goal of making contact with Hickory.

00:23:51.700 --> 00:23:58.520
Beltachika presses Amuro to reawaken, while at the same time she's determined to help Char and Camille get back into space.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:03.840
After that, Amuro takes the Rick Diaz and battles with the Ashamar.

00:24:04.764 --> 00:24:06.844
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam.

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:11.320
Through the haze of darkness, you will see the tears of time.
